  "title": "Rhubarb Cherry Crisp",
  "description": "This rhubarb cherry crisp combines cherry pie filling with fresh rhubarb for a sweet-tart flavor combination. Brown sugar, oats, and pecans make the perfect topping.",
  "authors": [
    "k_savaria"
  ],
